; Announced zone encounters. docs/NEWS_SYSTEM_DESIGN.md 5 is the design record.
; No spaces in values: the engine ini parser mangles them. Lists use commas.
;
; kind          sighting | ambush | infestation; the last two run only with enc_ambush / enc_infestation
; spawnN        section,count,x,y,z,lv,gv
; anchor        smart name, resolved at spawn; anchor_spawn = section,count
; has_info      any of these (none listed: open); no_info: none of these
; min_chapter, max_chapter  olr_cfg.chapter(); window any | day | night
; corpses       section,count: lootless bodies by spawn1, released with the ttl
; cooldown, ttl game hours; ttl 0 never releases
; sender        nearest | unknown | name:<string key>; icon = amk.tips_icons key
; npc, alive    the giver, by object name and story id; reward lvl1-lvl4, reward_hours
; alpha         string key: the first spawned member becomes an alpha with that name (olr_alpha.make)
; text          string keys, one is picked
; fl news_encounters.list()  shows every template and why it can or cannot fire

